   "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
   "text": "Settings differ (memcmp) -> reset(): spp_ = 0\nnext dispatch runs with uFrame = 0:\n  prev = uFrame == 0 ? vec4(0) : imageLoad(uAccum, px);\n  imageStore(uAccum, px, prev + vec4(L, 1));\nso the old sum is overwritten, not averaged in.",
   "originalText": "Settings differ (memcmp) -> reset(): spp_ = 0\nnext dispatch runs with uFrame = 0:\n  prev = uFrame == 0 ? vec4(0) : imageLoad(uAccum, px);\n  imageStore(uAccum, px, prev + vec4(L, 1));\nso the old sum is overwritten, not averaged in.",
