   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "strokeSharpness": "sharp",
   "text": "Measured RMSE vs a 16 384 spp reference (640 x 360, docs/pathtracer-benchmarks.md): 1 spp 0.1018, 4: 0.0561, 16: 0.0326, 64: 0.0203, 256: 0.0119,\n1024: 0.0068, 4096: 0.0040. Each 4x more samples cuts the error by about 0.57 (1/sqrt(N) predicts 0.5 for linear radiance).",
   "originalText": "Measured RMSE vs a 16 384 spp reference (640 x 360, docs/pathtracer-benchmarks.md): 1 spp 0.1018, 4: 0.0561, 16: 0.0326, 64: 0.0203, 256: 0.0119,\n1024: 0.0068, 4096: 0.0040. Each 4x more samples cuts the error by about 0.57 (1/sqrt(N) predicts 0.5 for linear radiance).",
